WEBVTT

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Awaken, Agumon

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Defeat Belphemon!

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:07.920
Awaken, Agumon!

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:09.500
Defeat Belphemon!

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:18.840
Kurata revived Belphemon and ordered the entire world to surrender unconditionally to him,

00:00:18.840 --> 00:00:21.750
but it was Tohma, who had supposedly betrayed Masaru, who stopped him.

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:42.120
In his anger, Kurata fused himself with Belphemon.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.840
Now, where is the fate of the world headed...?!

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:57.640
I want to save my friends.

00:00:59.260 --> 00:01:01.810
Everyone is fighting for their lives,

00:01:01.810 --> 00:01:05.310
but we're the only ones forced to stay on the sidelines!

00:01:05.310 --> 00:01:07.020
I can't deal with that!

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:11.320
I don't know what'll happen, but I'm going to where everyone else is!

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:16.320
We're heading there right now!

00:01:16.320 --> 00:01:17.490
Just wait,

00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:18.660
you guys!

00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:36.100
Damn that Kurata!

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:37.510
I'll never forgive him for this!

00:01:39.970 --> 00:01:41.380
Agumon!

00:01:41.380 --> 00:01:43.310
Let's fight together!

00:01:43.310 --> 00:01:46.870
Even though you're a Digiegg right now, our feelings are the same!

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:48.840
Right, Agumon?

00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:57.030
It's Tohma and MirageGaogamon.

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:04.620
Did they come to help Kurata?

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:07.080
MirageGaogamon!

00:02:07.580 --> 00:02:08.600
Yes, Master!

00:02:09.170 --> 00:02:11.600
Full Moon Blaster!

00:02:17.940 --> 00:02:19.590
He attacked Belphemon!

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:21.820
I knew it! Tohma-kun was...!

00:02:22.960 --> 00:02:25.560
He didn't betray us after all!

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:29.700
Tohma!

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:30.730
Did you finish the stuff you had to do?

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:32.960
Yes.

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:34.440
I'm sorry for worrying you.

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:39.730
Give me a week's worth of Usagiya's finest bean jam rice cakes.

00:02:39.730 --> 00:02:41.290
Then I'll forgive you.

00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:48.100
He took no damage!

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:52.520
How dare you have the gall to betray me!

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:55.460
Tohma Norstein!

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:57.580
Professor Kurata!

00:02:57.580 --> 00:03:00.630
You hated the Digimon with such intensity...

00:03:00.630 --> 00:03:04.260
and yet you fused with Belphemon, who is also a Digimon!

00:03:04.510 --> 00:03:05.760
What a fool.

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:10.730
We'll soon find out which of us is the real fool!

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:12.610
MirageGaogamon!

00:03:12.610 --> 00:03:13.620
Plan B!

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:14.530
Yes, Master!

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:20.360
Gale Claw!

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:25.410
This body is truly perfect.

00:03:25.820 --> 00:03:29.040
Quick reaction speed and immense power! Magnificent!

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:31.470
Now that I am fused with Belphemon,

00:03:31.470 --> 00:03:35.830
I've become the ultimate existence who has far surpassed both human and Digimon!

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:37.790
MirageGaogamon!

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:39.800
Change to Plan B+!

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:41.500
Yes, Master!

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:48.340
I can block all of your actions with the mere raise of my hands!

00:03:56.810 --> 00:03:57.940
MirageGaogamon!

00:04:00.580 --> 00:04:02.360
He has more power than us.

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:04.210
Drawing this out gives us a disadvantage.

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:15.090
The one who's fighting Belphemon is...

00:04:15.090 --> 00:04:16.760
MirageGaogamon!

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:19.800
Tohma!

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:21.760
Masaru!

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:21.760
Masaru!

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:26.470
Tohma!

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:39.520
Tohma!

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:39.520
Tohma!

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:03.590
They don't shake.

00:05:03.590 --> 00:05:04.970
They don't waver.

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:06.430
And they don't change.

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:10.540
That's why your fists leave such an impact on the heart.

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:16.570
Masaru.

00:05:17.090 --> 00:05:19.340
Kurata fused himself with Belphemon.

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:20.330
He's a tough one.

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:21.550
Fine by me!

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:22.980
I'll kick his ass!

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:28.060
This is considered making up?

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:30.950
Men are idiots.

00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:39.870
That sort of attack won't even leave a scratch on me.

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:43.010
<i>This</i>  is the right way to attack!

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:51.020
What's the matter?

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:53.410
Do you want me to crush you lying down like that?

00:06:54.060 --> 00:06:56.160
The one who's gonna get crushed here is you!

00:06:56.690 --> 00:06:57.540
What?

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:02.120
Kurata!

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:05.400
You think you can win against me with your bare hands?

00:07:08.350 --> 00:07:09.570
MirageGaogamon!

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:10.460
Yes, Master!

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:16.000
Masaru!

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:18.200
One more try!

00:07:18.420 --> 00:07:19.050
Don't!

00:07:19.860 --> 00:07:22.100
It's impossible when you don't have your partner!

00:07:22.950 --> 00:07:24.680
Stay here for now.

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:28.820
MirageGaogamon!

00:07:28.820 --> 00:07:30.070
Plan C!

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:31.360
Yes, Master!

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:36.070
Double Crescent Mirage!

00:07:41.320 --> 00:07:42.910
Where are you aiming?

00:07:43.570 --> 00:07:45.700
Gale Claw!

00:07:49.930 --> 00:07:50.630
Behind me, eh?

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:52.080
Too late!

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:54.480
Full Moon Blaster!

00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:58.510
What?

00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:58.510
What?

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:10.940
Are you all right?

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:12.450
Yes.

00:08:14.490 --> 00:08:15.930
Brother...

00:08:18.320 --> 00:08:19.370
Damn it!

00:08:21.510 --> 00:08:22.590
Where is he?

00:08:25.290 --> 00:08:25.960
Above you!

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:33.130
MirageGaogamon!

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:33.130
MirageGaogamon!

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:39.930
It must be pretty sad, being so weak...

00:08:39.930 --> 00:08:42.800
You're not worthy enough even to play around with.

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:44.440
Now...

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:49.650
Let me kill you instantly and bring you peace!

00:08:55.420 --> 00:08:57.770
Don't forget that we're here, too!

00:09:04.300 --> 00:09:05.850
My, my.

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:09.920
Why don't you understand that no matter how large your numbers, the end result will still be the same?

00:09:10.310 --> 00:09:11.130
Rosemon!

00:09:11.460 --> 00:09:14.150
Roses Rapier!

00:09:16.670 --> 00:09:17.720
Yatagaramon!

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:19.680
Mikafutsu-no-kami!

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:21.680
BishopChessmon!

00:09:22.300 --> 00:09:24.040
Bishop Laser!

00:09:28.900 --> 00:09:29.950
RookChessmon!

00:09:29.950 --> 00:09:30.560
Use your defense!

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:32.370
Castle Wall!

00:09:35.900 --> 00:09:37.290
Magnificent!

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:39.450
This power and this body!

00:09:40.050 --> 00:09:40.910
That's right.

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:45.660
I am the ultimate existence that has exceeded both human and Digimon!

00:09:46.030 --> 00:09:49.630
There's no chance that the likes of you can win against me!

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:53.210
You guys...

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:56.360
I won't lose!

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:57.380
Yatagaramon!

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:02.900
I told you, it's no use!

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:13.150
Falcomon!

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:21.870
It's because you oppose me that vermin like yourselves end up like this!

00:10:24.010 --> 00:10:26.900
Don't... kill any more of my friends!

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:27.780
Ikuto!

00:10:27.780 --> 00:10:29.970
You think Digimon are your friends?

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:32.820
Vermin as friends...

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:35.260
What a ridiculous notion!

00:10:37.050 --> 00:10:41.210
As you are well aware, all of the Digimon I've killed...

00:10:41.210 --> 00:10:45.520
those friends of yours, have provided the energy to revive this Belphemon.

00:10:45.520 --> 00:10:49.570
In other words, they were the provisions that helped grant my ambitions!

00:10:51.060 --> 00:10:53.950
Their existence alone is worthless

00:10:53.950 --> 00:10:57.050
and I have given that existence an important duty!

00:10:57.050 --> 00:11:00.780
I find no reason for you to hate me. Instead, you should be thanking me!

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:02.940
That's completely selfish of you!

00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:04.490
You...!

00:11:04.490 --> 00:11:06.240
You know nothing!

00:11:06.650 --> 00:11:08.540
Digimon are living beings!

00:11:09.280 --> 00:11:11.900
Just like humans, they live!

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:13.130
Huh?

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:15.170
I know!

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:16.920
Yukidarumon...

00:11:16.920 --> 00:11:20.230
She had a heart... a bigger heart than anyone else!

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:24.900
She raised me, even though I was human.

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:29.310
She scolded me.

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:32.030
She was gentle to me!

00:11:33.110 --> 00:11:35.810
She was very, very warm...!

00:11:37.950 --> 00:11:40.240
You know nothing!

00:11:40.240 --> 00:11:43.330
About Yukidarumon, or the Digimon!

00:11:45.280 --> 00:11:46.600
I...

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:48.160
pity you!

00:11:48.710 --> 00:11:51.170
What a stupid concept.

00:11:51.170 --> 00:11:53.500
Digimon having hearts?

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:57.740
Fussing over such nonsense is what's making you this weak!

00:11:58.860 --> 00:11:59.820
Look!

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:01.320
Look at this strength!

00:12:01.890 --> 00:12:06.020
This perfect body that I've obtained through the power of science!

00:12:06.020 --> 00:12:11.810
A human who can achieve vast accomplishments for himself is the most excellent of life forms!

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:15.400
Humans and Digimon are same!

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:16.230
They're friends!

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:18.900
Ikuto!

00:12:18.970 --> 00:12:20.380
Humans the best?

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:21.170
No!

00:12:21.780 --> 00:12:23.100
Digimon the best?

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:23.920
No!

00:12:24.820 --> 00:12:27.950
Yukidarumon taught me warmth...

00:12:27.950 --> 00:12:30.580
Mercurimon taught me discipline...

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:34.040
Other Digimon taught me competition!

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:38.760
Masaru and others taught me the importance of friends!

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:41.270
All of them are my friends!

00:12:44.730 --> 00:12:46.340
You have no friends!

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:48.300
I'll win!

00:12:48.860 --> 00:12:50.380
Because I have friends!

00:12:53.300 --> 00:12:54.290
Ikuto!

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:04.530
Digisoul Charge!

00:13:04.530 --> 00:13:05.980
Overdrive!

00:13:07.530 --> 00:13:09.180
Falcomon, evolve!

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:27.930
Ravemon!

00:13:28.130 --> 00:13:39.100
Ravemon

00:13:28.130 --> 00:13:39.100
Ultimate Level

00:13:28.560 --> 00:13:29.740
Ravemon.

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:34.490
An Ultimate Level Digimon whose black wing conceals himself, while his white wing slices the enemy.

00:13:34.490 --> 00:13:36.660
His special attack is Blast Wing.

00:13:36.660 --> 00:13:39.100
The wing on his left arm cleaves through the enemy!

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:42.480
He evolved to Ultimate?

00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:43.840
Great job, Ikuto!

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:44.820
You're the man!

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:45.740
Ravemon!

00:13:46.420 --> 00:13:48.230
Spiral Raven Claw!

00:13:50.020 --> 00:13:52.370
You can't win against my current form...!

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:54.660
Wh-What is this power?

00:13:55.330 --> 00:13:57.160
You don't know!

00:13:57.160 --> 00:13:58.270
This is...!

00:13:57.160 --> 00:13:58.270
This is...!

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:00.670
The power that comes from cherishing our friends!

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:06.970
All right!

00:14:08.100 --> 00:14:11.450
Don't get cocky just because you've nicked me once!

00:14:17.760 --> 00:14:18.660
Ravemon!

00:14:18.660 --> 00:14:19.760
Tear him to pieces!

00:14:19.760 --> 00:14:20.950
Blast Wing!

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:25.560
Impossible!

00:14:25.560 --> 00:14:27.030
Why is this happening?

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:29.790
How can a mere insect have such power...?!

00:14:30.420 --> 00:14:31.730
Chou Oumaru!

00:14:30.420 --> 00:14:31.730
Raven King Sword

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:38.200
Now change our feelings into power!

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:41.980
And unleash all of it!

00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:45.240
Ame-no-ohabari!

00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:49.540
NOTE: <i>Ame-no-ohabari</i> (天之尾羽張) is the name of the sword that Izanagi, in Shinto mythology, used to behead his son, Kagu-tsuchi.

00:14:50.310 --> 00:14:51.340
All right!

00:14:50.310 --> 00:14:51.340
All right!

00:14:52.010 --> 00:14:53.340
Nice one, Ikuto!

00:14:53.340 --> 00:14:54.270
Ravemon!

00:14:54.270 --> 00:14:55.970
You little insect...

00:14:55.970 --> 00:14:58.750
How dare you do this to me!

00:14:59.530 --> 00:15:01.770
Unforgivable!

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:10.820
What's he doing?!

00:15:10.820 --> 00:15:12.110
He's powering up!

00:15:12.570 --> 00:15:13.580
Ravemon!

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:14.660
One more time!

00:15:15.490 --> 00:15:16.940
Ame-no-ohabari!

00:15:22.470 --> 00:15:23.880
Unforgivable!

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:26.000
It didn't work!

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:29.880
Those who cross me...

00:15:32.130 --> 00:15:33.190
Ravemon!

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:35.170
...are served judgment!

00:15:42.390 --> 00:15:43.150
Yoshino!

00:15:43.150 --> 00:15:43.870
Ikuto!

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:48.400
Master!

00:16:08.990 --> 00:16:09.840
Ikuto...

00:16:09.990 --> 00:16:11.030
Ravemon...

00:16:15.060 --> 00:16:16.100
Ikuto!

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:17.850
You idiot!

00:16:17.850 --> 00:16:19.870
Why'd you do that?!

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:23.930
Because you guys are my friends...

00:16:23.930 --> 00:16:25.540
Friends are important...

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:26.650
Ikuto...

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:29.900
Kurata!

00:16:30.330 --> 00:16:32.580
You are definitely going down!

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:37.890
I am not... Kurata...!

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:40.410
What?

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:44.910
I am the Demon Lord...

00:16:44.910 --> 00:16:46.650
Belphemon!

00:16:54.380 --> 00:16:55.960
What the hell is going on?

00:16:55.960 --> 00:16:57.070
I think...

00:16:57.070 --> 00:17:00.640
Kurata's consciousness was consumed by Belphemon's instincts!

00:17:04.530 --> 00:17:05.600
Then, it can't be...!

00:17:07.220 --> 00:17:09.780
As long as Belphemon's instincts are in command,

00:17:09.780 --> 00:17:11.570
he'll start attacking without discrimination!

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:14.580
He won't stop until everything is destroyed!

00:17:21.270 --> 00:17:23.520
I hope Masaru-niichan is okay...

00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:26.740
Agu-chan is still a Digiegg...

00:17:27.490 --> 00:17:28.730
It'll be all right.

00:17:29.460 --> 00:17:32.730
Besides, Agu-chan will definitely come back.

00:17:33.770 --> 00:17:36.640
Agu-chan loves Masaru...

00:17:36.640 --> 00:17:39.970
just as much as Masaru loves him.

00:17:45.150 --> 00:17:46.020
Rosemon!

00:17:46.940 --> 00:17:48.980
Spiral Raven Claw!

00:17:52.180 --> 00:17:53.420
I can still fight!

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:57.820
MirageGaogamon!

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:02.990
RookChessmon!

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:02.990
BishopChessmon!

00:18:05.740 --> 00:18:07.080
Look, Agumon.

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:12.880
Everyone's worn out, but they're still fighting for dear life!

00:18:15.630 --> 00:18:18.860
And yet, we're the only ones who can't join them!

00:18:21.550 --> 00:18:23.390
As a man, this is a disgrace!

00:18:25.390 --> 00:18:26.310
Agumon...

00:18:27.350 --> 00:18:30.230
I want to fight with you!

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:41.500
I want to fight!

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:43.360
With you!

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:46.840
Don't you feel the same?!

00:18:46.840 --> 00:18:47.870
Agumon!

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:04.600
Agumon...!

00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:17.820
What are you doing, Agumon?!

00:19:19.520 --> 00:19:20.550
You're...

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:24.500
not... Agumon...

00:19:25.700 --> 00:19:31.360
<i>After being reborn, Agumon probably won't even remember the days he spent with you.</i>

00:19:37.060 --> 00:19:38.600
I knew it...

00:19:39.580 --> 00:19:43.540
You forgot everything about me...!

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:54.520
What are you talkin' about, Aniki?

00:19:56.440 --> 00:19:58.490
I'm hungry.

00:19:58.990 --> 00:20:00.370
You...

00:20:00.370 --> 00:20:03.030
You still remember me?!

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:11.300
Aniki...

00:20:11.300 --> 00:20:12.720
Are you crying?

00:20:15.590 --> 00:20:17.020
No, you idiot!

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:19.340
That's just sweat dripping from my heart!

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:28.170
I'll let you eat whatever you want later!

00:20:28.170 --> 00:20:29.850
But more importantly, Agumon!

00:20:29.850 --> 00:20:31.810
I want to fight with you!

00:20:32.550 --> 00:20:33.540
Aniki!

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:34.620
I do, too!

00:20:40.820 --> 00:20:41.650
That light!

00:20:45.360 --> 00:20:49.580
A pure Digisoul cannot be born from a fist of hatred.

00:21:10.840 --> 00:21:13.150
Let's go, Agumon!

00:21:13.150 --> 00:21:16.140
After we beat Kurata, we'll stuff our faces with good food!

00:21:16.140 --> 00:21:17.140
Yeah!

00:21:17.140 --> 00:21:20.410
Make sure there's lots of Sayuri's fried eggs with that, Aniki!

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:26.570
